      "desc": "默认 GLM-OCR；所有模型共用上方 Private API Key，直接识别当前截图。"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "roboflowWorkflowId",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "② Roboflow · 自定义 Workflow（可选）",
